  Δ = -392 kJ/ mol + 340 kJ/ mol + 762 kJ/ mol

  ΔH = ** 710 kJ/ mol**


 
**Therefore, the enthalpy change for the reaction between [Fe(H2O)6]²+ and 2Cl- ions to produce [FeCl4]²- is 710 kJ/ mol.**
