*  ΔH is the enthalpy change of the reaction
*  ΔH_f is the enthalpy of formation for each species

**2. Apply the given values:**

*  ΔH_f(CaO) = -635.1 kJ/ mol
*  ΔH_f(H2O) = -285.8 kJ/ mol
*  ΔH_f(Ca(OH)₂) = -986.2 kJ/ mol

