  $$Z_1 = \int_{0}^{\infty} P(E) dE = \int_{0}^{\infty} \frac{1}{Z} \frac{d}{dE} \left( \frac{1}{e^{E/kT}}\right) dE = \frac{1}{Z} \frac{-1}{e^{E/kT}} \right_{0}^{\infty} = \frac{k T}{m} $$

